From 82d45a73cfead6387e8be2e8e47de14d4461c19b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/39] fix: export reads credit_reward from daily entry for
 multi-level daily campaigns
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

For isDailyMode && is_multi_level campaigns, the export was calling
buildMultiLevelPlayerMetrics which reads from campaign_player_levels
(non-daily records), returning 0. Fixed to read entry.credit_reward
directly from daily_turnover_entries — same source used by the payout
table and summary totals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DqGp4gVeTBMvwho4pP8n8C
